{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:44 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:44 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:44 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"警員到賓館調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/d0194c60d338557a6179f03121f2dc7a/2026-10/page_161.jpg\"/><p>今日（21日）中午12時12分，油麻地永星里1B號一間賓館的一名中年男住客，被發現倒臥在房間內，不省人事。救護員到場，經檢驗男子已當場死亡。警方調查後證實死者姓曾（48歲），列作「屍體發現」案件，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><img alt=\"賓館男住客暈倒死亡。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c92810dc0c11feb6b185e2eb2de8b22/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_35_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29e19c177431adc5292e9f51d477299d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_35_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是永星里1B號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9321a2b6f58171a83f5c0c64ed7d3395/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_35_05.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06cac355ca1d000f48aef88724cfdb03/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_35_04.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c8542c8e8f4358bc8b1ea02b9b404c2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_35_01.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7288169afd6dbaba552744ce4180b8a8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_34_55.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T06:36:20.555330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:44:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T06:57:44.044687+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:34:09.472655+00:00","content_hash":"3a45975e7becd910d7b651870f4986dc2a04377ef5f63ec365f54d5376b57912","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}